"<main role=\"main\" aria-label=\"PRP-TCM Therapy - Platelet-Rich Plasma Combined with TCM\" class=\"min-h-screen bg-white\"><section class=\"relative min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-900 via-teal-900 to-slate-900\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-black/40\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center text-white py-32\"><div style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-bold mb-6\">PRP中医关节再生疗法</h1><p class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl text-teal-200 mb-4\">国际医疗</p><p class=\"text-lg text-gray-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8\">中西医结合 · 标本兼治 · 零等待 · 安全合规</p><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4\"><button class=\"px-8 py-4 bg-teal-500 text-white font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-teal-600 transition-colors\">立即咨询</button><button class=\"px-8 py-4 border-2 border-white text-white font-semibold rounded-lg hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\">了解更多</button></div></div></div><div class=\"absolute bottom-8 left-1/2 transform -translate-x-1/2\" style=\"opacity: 1;\"><div class=\"w-6 h-10 border-2 border-white/50 rounded-full flex justify-center\"><div class=\"w-1.5 h-3 bg-white rounded-full mt-2\" style=\"transform: translateY(0.533059px);\"></div></div></div></section><section id=\"intro\" class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-20 items-center\"><div style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-30px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-6\">什么是PRP中医关节再生疗法？</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-lg mb-6\">PRP（Platelet-Rich Plasma，富血小板血浆）中医关节再生疗法是一种将现代再生医学技术与传统中医智慧相结合的创新治疗方案。</p><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-6\">通过提取患者自身血液中的高浓度血小板血浆，配合中医针灸、中药熏蒸、推拿等传统疗法，实现关节软骨修复、炎症消退和功能恢复的三重目标。</p><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-4 text-teal-600\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle \"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span class=\"font-semibold\">国际标准认证 · 安全有效</span></div></div><div class=\"relative\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateX(30px);\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1576091160550-2173dba999ef?w=800&amp;q=80\" alt=\"PRP Treatment\" class=\"rounded-2xl shadow-2xl w-full\"></div></div></div></section><section id=\"advantages\" class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-slate-50\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">核心优势</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">四大核心优势，为您的关节健康保驾护航</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-teal-100 text-teal-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-activity \"><path d=\"M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">中西合璧，效果倍增</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600\">PRP通过高浓度生长因子促进软骨修复和抗炎镇痛，中医通过针灸、中药等手段疏通经络、调和气血。二者联合可产生协同增效——临床数据显示，PRP联合温针灸后，患者关节功能恢复指标提升显著，软骨缺损修复速度较单纯PRP治疗提升2.1倍。</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-teal-100 text-teal-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield \"><path d=\"M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">标本兼治的完整方案</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600\">不仅解决关节疼痛症状，更通过中医整体调理改善体质，从根本上延缓关节退化进程，实现长期稳定的疗效。</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-teal-100 text-teal-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-clock \"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><polyline points=\"12 6 12 12 16 14\"></polyline></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">零等待</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600\">无需排队数月，从咨询到治疗一般仅需1-2周即可完成。</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-16 h-16 bg-teal-100 text-teal-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mb-6\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-award \"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"8\" r=\"6\"></circle><path d=\"M15.477 12.89 17 22l-5-3-5 3 1.523-9.11\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">安全合规</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600\">PRP治疗中国各等级医院及临床研究广泛应用，中医治疗有国家级指南规范。</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"indications\" class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">适应症</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">以下情况适合接受PRP中医关节再生疗法</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow border border-gray-100\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1559757175-5700dde675bc?w=600&amp;q=80\" alt=\"早中期膝骨关节炎\" class=\"w-full h-48 object-cover\"><div class=\"p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">早中期膝骨关节炎</h3><p class=\"text-teal-600 text-sm mb-4\">Kellgren-Lawrence分级Ⅰ-Ⅲ级</p><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-600 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-500 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>关节疼痛、晨僵、活动受限</li><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-600 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-500 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>对口服止痛药/玻璃酸钠注射效果不佳或不良反应不耐受</li><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-600 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-500 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>希望保留自然关节、推迟或避免关节置换</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow border border-gray-100\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1612349317150-e413f6a5b16d?w=600&amp;q=80\" alt=\"关节软骨轻度至中度磨损\" class=\"w-full h-48 object-cover\"><div class=\"p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">关节软骨轻度至中度磨损</h3><p class=\"text-teal-600 text-sm mb-4\">MRI显示软骨变薄、局灶性缺损</p><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-600 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-500 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>软骨变薄、局灶性缺损</li><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-600 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-500 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>尚未达到全层大范围缺失</li><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-600 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-500 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>适合PRP修复治疗</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow border border-gray-100\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1571019614242-c5c5dee9f50b?w=600&amp;q=80\" alt=\"慢性运动损伤相关性关节病\" class=\"w-full h-48 object-cover\"><div class=\"p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">慢性运动损伤相关性关节病</h3><p class=\"text-teal-600 text-sm mb-4\">长期运动导致的关节问题</p><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-600 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-500 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>韧带损伤</li><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-600 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-500 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>软骨磨损伴关节疼痛</li><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-600 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-500 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>运动员关节保护</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow border border-gray-100\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1581056771107-24ca5f4d9b6d?w=600&amp;q=80\" alt=\"关节镜/微骨折术后康复\" class=\"w-full h-48 object-cover\"><div class=\"p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">关节镜/微骨折术后康复</h3><p class=\"text-teal-600 text-sm mb-4\">术后联合PRP+中医康复</p><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-600 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-500 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>有效促进软骨修复</li><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-600 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-500 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>减轻术后僵硬</li><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-600 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-500 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>加速康复进程</li></ul></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow border border-gray-100\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1505751172876-fa1923c5c528?w=600&amp;q=80\" alt=\"对西药不耐受或有安全性顾虑者\" class=\"w-full h-48 object-cover\"><div class=\"p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-lg font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">对西药不耐受或有安全性顾虑者</h3><p class=\"text-teal-600 text-sm mb-4\">希望通过中医整体调理</p><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-600 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-500 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>减少非甾体抗炎药依赖</li><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-600 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-500 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>中医整体调理方案</li><li class=\"flex items-start text-gray-600 text-sm\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-teal-500 mr-2 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg>个性化治疗方案</li></ul></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"treatment\" class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-slate-50\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">治疗内容</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">三大治疗模块，全方位关节康复方案</p></div><div class=\"space-y-8\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-4 mb-6\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-teal-100 text-teal-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-activity \"><path d=\"M22 12h-4l-3 9L9 3l-3 9H2\"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E]\">模块一：PRP核心治疗</h3><p class=\"text-teal-600\">Platelet-Rich Plasma Therapy</p></div></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-6\"><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-4\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-teal-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold mb-3\">1</div><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">静脉抽血</h4><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">20-50ml血液采集</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-4\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-teal-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold mb-3\">2</div><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">高速离心制备</h4><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">血小板浓缩至正常3-5倍</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-4\"><div class=\"w-8 h-8 bg-teal-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold mb-3\">3</div><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">超声引导注射</h4><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">精准关节腔注射</p></div></div><p class=\"text-gray-500 text-sm bg-slate-50 p-4 rounded-lg\">通常一个疗程为2-4次注射，每次间隔2-4周，具体视个体情况由医师制定</p></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-4 mb-6\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-teal-100 text-teal-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-leaf \"><path d=\"M11 20A7 7 0 0 1 9.8 6.1C15.5 5 17 4.48 19 2c1 2 2 4.18 2 8 0 5.5-4.78 10-10 10Z\"></path><path d=\"M2 21c0-3 1.85-5.36 5.08-6C9.5 14.52 12 13 13 12\"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E]\">模块二：中医协同治疗</h3><p class=\"text-teal-600\">Traditional Chinese Medicine</p></div></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-4\"><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-4 text-center\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">针灸治疗</h4><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">即刻止痛，疏通经络</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-4 text-center\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">中药内服</h4><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">整体调理，调和气血</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-4 text-center\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">中药熏蒸</h4><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">局部渗透，温通经络</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-4 text-center\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">推拿手法</h4><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">滑利关节，松解粘连</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-4 text-center\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">艾灸疗法</h4><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">温通散寒，活血化瘀</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex items-center space-x-4 mb-6\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-teal-100 text-teal-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-heart \"><path d=\"M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z\"></path></svg></div><div><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E]\">模块三：功能锻炼与康复指导</h3><p class=\"text-teal-600\">Rehabilitation &amp; Exercise</p></div></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-4\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">肌力训练</h4><p class=\"text-gray-600\">指导股四头肌等长收缩训练，强化膝关节稳定性</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-xl p-4\"><h4 class=\"font-semibold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">传统功法</h4><p class=\"text-gray-600\">推荐八段锦、太极拳等传统养生功法，促进长期关节养护</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"process\" class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">治疗流程</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">八步完整流程，从咨询到康复全程陪伴</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-4 gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 relative\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-teal-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold mb-4\">1</div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">线上咨询与病历评估</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">提交膝关节X光负重位、MRI影像、既往治疗史和相关检查报告，医学顾问进行资料审核和初步适应症筛查</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 relative\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-teal-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold mb-4\">2</div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">远程会诊确认方案</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">骨科+康复科+中医科医师联合视频会诊，确定治疗方案、费用预估和治疗行程安排，提供中英文双语治疗计划</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 relative\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-teal-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold mb-4\">3</div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">医疗签证与赴华行程安排</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">出具医疗邀请函，指导办理S2/S1医疗签证，协助预订机票、安排机场接送和医院附近住宿</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 relative\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-teal-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold mb-4\">4</div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">入院前全面评估与基线检测</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">完成必需检查：血常规、凝血功能、传染病筛查、血脂、血小板计数、心电图等，中医体质辨识和膝关节影像复核</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 relative\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-teal-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold mb-4\">5</div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">PRP治疗实施</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">超声引导下富血小板血浆关节腔精准注射，门诊完成（约45-60分钟），治疗后观察约1小时即可正常活动</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 relative\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-teal-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold mb-4\">6</div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">中医协同治疗</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">PRP注射当天针灸协同促进PRP均匀分布，注射间期针灸2-3次/周，中药熏蒸每日1次，推拿艾灸巩固疗效</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 relative\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-teal-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold mb-4\">7</div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">术后康复指导与出院</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">康复医师制定个性化功能锻炼方案，为需要长期中药调理的患者安排邮寄中药丸剂/膏方服务</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 relative\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-10 h-10 bg-teal-500 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-bold mb-4\">8</div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">远程随访与健康管理</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">提供移动端疼痛评分和关节功能自评系统，远程视频复诊，按需进行MRI影像对比分析评估软骨修复进展</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"efficacy\" class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-slate-900 text-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4\">疗效数据</h2><p class=\"text-gray-400 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">临床研究证实，PRP联合中医治疗疗效显著</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.9);\"><div class=\"text-5xl font-bold text-teal-400 mb-2\">181</div><p class=\"text-gray-300\">例患者临床研究</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.9);\"><div class=\"text-5xl font-bold text-teal-400 mb-2\">2.1x</div><p class=\"text-gray-300\">软骨修复速度提升</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-800 rounded-2xl p-8 text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: scale(0.9);\"><div class=\"text-5xl font-bold text-teal-400 mb-2\">显著</div><p class=\"text-gray-300\">WOMAC/VAS 评分改善</p></div></div></div></section><section id=\"cases\" class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-slate-50\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">真实案例</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">患者真实反馈，见证疗效</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1546519638-68e109498ffc?w=600&amp;q=80\" alt=\"三次跨洋飞回中国接受PRP治疗\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover\"><div class=\"p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">三次跨洋飞回中国接受PRP治疗</h3><p class=\"text-teal-600 text-sm mb-4\">职业球员重返赛场</p><p class=\"text-gray-600\">美国籍职业篮球运动员Dwayne在深圳结束赛事后右膝疼痛难忍。医生通过肌骨超声精准诊断右膝关节髌韧带损伤、内侧支持带损伤、关节软骨磨损。三次PRP治疗后，Dwayne右膝疼痛基本缓解，重新投入到钟爱的篮球事业中。</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl overflow-hidden shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1576091160399-112ba8d25d1d?w=600&amp;q=80\" alt=\"181例患者的真实效果——步态明显改善\" class=\"w-full h-56 object-cover\"><div class=\"p-6\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">181例患者的真实效果——步态明显改善</h3><p class=\"text-teal-600 text-sm mb-4\">临床研究数据</p><p class=\"text-gray-600\">181例膝骨关节炎患者临床研究证实：温针灸联合PRP注射治疗的患者，在治疗后步频、步速、步长以及关节支撑相占比均明显优于单纯PRP组；WOMAC评分、VAS评分显著降低，HSS关节评分显著升高，且不良反应发生率无显著增加。</p></div></div></div></div></section><section id=\"services\" class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">支持服务</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 max-w-2xl mx-auto\">全程贴心服务，让您无忧就医</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-teal-100 text-teal-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-globe \"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"10\"></circle><path d=\"M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20\"></path><path d=\"M2 12h20\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">签证指导与办理</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">专业团队协助办理医疗签证</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-teal-100 text-teal-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin \"><path d=\"M20 10c0 6-8 12-8 12s-8-6-8-12a8 8 0 0 1 16 0Z\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">落地接待与交通</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">机场接送及全程交通安排</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-teal-100 text-teal-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-users \"><path d=\"M16 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-4-4H6a4 4 0 0 0-4 4v2\"></path><circle cx=\"9\" cy=\"7\" r=\"4\"></circle><path d=\"M22 21v-2a4 4 0 0 0-3-3.87\"></path><path d=\"M16 3.13a4 4 0 0 1 0 7.75\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">语言支持与医疗翻译</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">专业医疗翻译全程陪同</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-teal-100 text-teal-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-heart \"><path d=\"M19 14c1.49-1.46 3-3.21 3-5.5A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 16.5 3c-1.76 0-3 .5-4.5 2-1.5-1.5-2.74-2-4.5-2A5.5 5.5 0 0 0 2 8.5c0 2.3 1.5 4.05 3 5.5l7 7Z\"></path></svg></div><h3 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-2\">陪诊与医疗协调</h3><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">专人协调就诊流程</p></div><div class=\"bg-slate-50 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center hover:shadow-lg transition-shadow\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"w-14 h-14 bg-teal-100 text-teal-600 rounded-xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-